WEBVTT

00:08:58.755 --> 00:09:01.993
to the well-being of others.

00:09:01.993 --> 00:09:05.262
Danger is shared. Pain is shared.

00:09:05.262 --> 00:09:08.187
Joy is shared. Achievement is shared.

00:09:08.187 --> 00:09:12.717
Houses are shared. Food is shared.

00:09:12.717 --> 00:09:15.913
Ubuntu asks us to open our hearts

00:09:15.913 --> 00:09:17.327
and to share,

00:09:17.327 --> 00:09:19.279
and what Solly taught me that day

00:09:19.279 --> 00:09:21.282
is the essence of this value,

00:09:21.282 --> 00:09:24.040
his animated, empathetic action

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.085
in every moment.

00:09:26.085 --> 00:09:29.592
Now although the root word is about people,

00:09:29.592 --> 00:09:32.966
I thought that maybe ubuntu was only about people.